      "say": {
        "translate": "quest.mebahelrpgrquest.ash_court_chain_6_the_court_answers.goals.0.say",
        "fallback": "The drowned rose when you broke the core's seal? Then the Court already knew where it lay. Give it here. I have bound it inside crying obsidian; this finished resonator will force the passage to answer only at the ward. Take it with three obsidian braces and three soul lanterns."
      }
    },
